n look and it was just lovely and i  was actually able to reuse the table  pieces as kind of like along the aisles  for the ceremony ultimately pleased with  the entire rent and return recycling  process kirstjen joyce live local now  now bercier says the floral arrangements  can be rented up to 26 times per year  and then in between each rental the  arrangements go through full quality  control changing out the stems before  they're shipped out once again
 

